    <briefdescription>
<para>DP TX Subsystem DSC/FEC Support Header. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Declares the Display Stream Compression and Forward Error Correction entry points of the DisplayPort 2.1 TX Subsystem. The whole interface is compiled only for designs that build the DSC encoder in. The subsystem instance is left unchanged, so the state is held in this translation unit. </para>    </detaileddescription>
